BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:5k-for-columbia-sisters-run-club-toronto@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260918T210051Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260830
SUMMARY:5K For Columbia
DESCRIPTION:Time: 15:00\\nDesc: SISTERS RUN CLUB TORONTO | SEASON 01 RUN 02 | 5K FOR COLOMBIA 🏃🏻‍♀️🇨🇴 🤍\n\nJoin us on August 30 for a 5K run/walk for Colombia\, a special fundraiser bringing women together through movement while supporting communities affected by the earthquake. \n\n📍 Downsview Park (Orchard Pavilion)\n🗓️ Sunday\, August 30\n⏰ Meet at 3:00 PM\n\nFREE TO JOIN • PAY WHAT YOU CAN\n100% of donations will support earthquake relief efforts in Colombia 🇨🇴🤍\n\nEnjoy some fast chews by @saltstick to keep us energized before the run ❤️💥\n\nAfter the run\, we’ll head to @goodbehaviour.to to relax\, connect\, and enjoy some delicious food together. When you join us\, you’ll also receive 20% off ice cream or smash burgers!🍦🍔 \n\nWhether you run or walk\, this is a space for everyone. All ages\, backgrounds\, and fitness levels are welcome. Come move at your own pace\, meet your community\, and help us give back 🤍\n\nSee you there\, sisters! 🏃🏻‍♀️
LOCATION:70 Canuck Ave\, North York\, ON M3K 2C5\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Sports
END:VEVENT
