BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pickleball-pilates@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260918T210051Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260830
RDATE;VALUE=DATE:20260823
SUMMARY:🎀Pickleball & Pilates
DESCRIPTION:Time: 14:00\\nDesc: 🗓️ Aug 30\, Sunday\n🎾 Pickleball Only: 2–4 PM\n🧘‍♀️Pilates + Pickleball: 3–5 PM\n📍 North York\, Toronto (exact address to be provided)\n\nThis is your sign to try a new side quest! 💅🏼\n\nCome move\, play\, meet new people\, and beat the Sunday scaries. \n\nYou can choose your side quest: join us for pickleball only or start with a Pilates flow before hitting the courts for some pickleball fun! 🎾🧘‍♀️\n\nBring your besties or come solo — you’ll leave with a workout\, new friends\, and hopefully a new obsession! 💗\n\nNo pickleball experience needed\; beginners welcome!\nPaddles are available to rent for free.
LOCATION:North York\, ON\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Sports
END:VEVENT
