BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:pilates-sisterscorner-aug29@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260918T210051Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260829
SUMMARY:🎀Pilates & Wellness Social
DESCRIPTION:Date: August 29\, 2026 · 11:00 AM\\nRegistration: Tickets available through the link in bio\\nOrganizer: The Muslim Sisters Corner GTA\\nInstagram: https://www.instagram.com/thesisterscorner_gta/\\nDesc: Join The Sisters Corner for our Pilates & Wellness Social\, an afternoon created for Muslim women to move\, reset\, connect\, and pour a little time back into themselves. 🧘🏻‍♀️🌷\n\nAs we head into a new academic year and a fresh season of routines\, we wanted to create a space to slow down\, take care of ourselves\, and be surrounded by a community of sisters. 🤍\n\nYour ticket includes:\n\n🩷 A professionally led Pilates class\n\n🧘🏻‍♀️ Your own Pilates mat to use and take home\n\n🎀 Curated gift bag\n\n🥣 Complimentary açaí bowl\n\n📸 Photo booth to capture the day\n\n🛍️ Local vendors to shop from throughout the event\n\n🌸 A beautiful wellness-inspired setup\n\n🤍 Time to meet and connect with Muslim women from across the GTA\n\nWhether you’re coming with friends or showing up on your own\, you’re more than welcome. Come spend the afternoon moving\, shopping\, taking cute pictures\, meeting new sisters\, and enjoying some much-needed time for yourself. 💗
LOCATION:Mississauga (see Instagram for exact venue)
CATEGORIES:Sports
END:VEVENT
