SUMMARY:Run Her
DESCRIPTION:Time: 10:00\\nDesc: all Run and PSL??? 🍂☕️🤎🏃🏽‍♀️\n\nJoin us on September 27th at 10 am @wet_coffee_community for RUN’HER FALL EDIT - a fall women’s community run and coffee social pop-up 🤎\n\nYour experience:\n• A beginner-friendly scenic fall run through Downtown Oakville 🏃🏽‍♀️🍂\n• A post-run coffee social featuring @wet_coffee_community new FALL drink menu 🍁☕️\n• Post-run wellness goodies 🤎\n\nAll levels are welcome - bring your running shoes\, your water bottle\, and a friend (or come solo and meet new ones 🤎)!\n\nTickets will be live via the link in our bio on September 13th at 6:00 pm EST - spots are limited 🏃🏽‍♀️🍂
