DESCRIPTION:Time: 17:30\\nDesc: SUMMER'S NOT OVER YET...\nBUT there's only 3 weekends left before fall •\nCome solo\, bring your girls\, make new friends here\, just don't let summer end from your couch!\nPOOL PARTY + MOVIE NIGHT UNDER THE STARS\n• Private secluded property in Burlington\n17 Sunday\, September 13\n© 5:30-9PM\nWe're taking over a completely private\, resort-style property for one last summer evening together:\na A warm swim in the heated pool\n• Mocktails poolside\nQ: Lounging\, cabanas & soaking up the last summer sun\nPizza dinner\n• Sunset views while swimming\n& Changing into your comfiest PJs after your swim\nin A cozy movie night under the stars i Snacks & good vibes
