UID:masks-n-mane@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260918T210051Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260927
SUMMARY:Masks n Mane
DESCRIPTION:Time: 16:00\\nDesc: What if your Sunday plans were simply... getting taken care of?\n\nIntroducing MASKS & MANE hosted by @the.ghee.mama.productions\, @skin9studio and @gistarallure - a beauty + self-care social created around all the little things we love doing\, except this time\, we've planned the whole afternoon for you.\n\nCome in\, settle down and start with a guided facial ritual by Skin 9 Studio - you will he taught and made to do double cleanse\, enzyme mask\, facial massage\, mask and aftercare.\n\nWanna fix your hair after the facial? Want to get side braids\, curls? You can get your little hair refresh with GistarAllure\, choosing from a curated menu of hairstyles.\n\nAnd in between? Make yourself a charm bracelet or keychain. Take cute photobooth pictures. Sip your coffee or matcha. Have your curated food box and charcuterie cup.\n\nMingle\, talk\, take pictures... or just sit and enjoy not having anywhere else to be.\n\nAnd yes\, you'll leave with a gua sha + face roller too.
LOCATION:2828 Kingsway Dr #3\, Oakville\, ON L6J 7M2\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Day Activities
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:medieval-painting@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260918T210051Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260926
RDATE;VALUE=DATE:20261003
SUMMARY:Medieval Painting
DESCRIPTION:Time: 12:00\\nDesc: Step into the medieval world of historic book arts in this hands-on painting course. Learn to draw traditional motifs\, paint with gouache\, and create an ornate border surrounding a poem — through pattern\, colour\, and storytelling.\n\nGuided by Professional Artist Nora Alkeyat. Templates and materials provided. Every student receives a FREE Medieval Drawing Workbook.\n18+ | Sisters only\nSaturday Sept 26 & Oct 3 (2-classes) | 12pm - 2pm\nMeadowvale Community Centre\, Program Room 2 | 6655 Glen Erin Dr\, Mississauga
LOCATION:6655 Glen Erin Dr\, Mississauga\, ON L5N 3L4\, Canada
CATEGORIES:Day Activities
END:VEVENT
