DESCRIPTION:Desc: Muslim Sisters Retreat in Essaouira\, Morocco 🌊☀️\n📅 22-29 November 2026\n\nA 7-day retreat for Muslim women to slow down\, reconnect & build real sisterhood\n\nWhat to expect:\n\n✨ Sisterhood\, deep talks & heart-to-heart conversations\n🕌 Praying together\, reconnecting with Allah & inner peace\n🎨 Activities like horse riding\, cooking class\, hammam & exploring the Medina\n🏡 Private villa & pool\, fresh & healthy Moroccan meals & time offline\n🌊 Beach walks\, fun & free time to just be\n
