BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:a-journey-home@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260918T210051Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261110
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261121
SUMMARY:🕋A Journey Home
DESCRIPTION:Desc: Umrah - A Journey Home 🤍\n\nThis retreat has been close to our hearts for many years\, and Alhamdulillah\, we now have the opportunity to share it with our community for a third year running.\n\nTogether\, we’ll explore places that have shaped our Islamic history\, walk through landscapes connected to the lives of the Prophets and the Sahabah (may Allah be pleased with them) and experience these stories in a way that brings them vividly to life. Alongside our visits to Makkah and Madinah\, we’ll spend time reflecting\, reconnecting with ourselves\, and strengthening our relationship with Allah.\n\nWhether this is your first Umrah or you’ve been blessed to visit before\, we pray this journey allows you to experience these sacred places with fresh eyes and an open heart.
LOCATION:Makkah Saudi Arabia
CATEGORIES:Trips
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:building-cultural-competency-to-support-muslim-women@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260918T210051Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260902
SUMMARY:Building Cultural Competency to Support Muslim Women
DESCRIPTION:Time: 12:00\\nDesc: Join CCMW LAW (Legal Advocacy for Women) for an engaging webinar exploring parenting and child support through both Canadian and Muslim family law frameworks\, with practical insights to better support Muslim women navigating family law matters.\n\nCPD Accreditation: \n1 hour Professionalism Content \n30 minutes EDI Professionalism Content \n\nThis webinar is designed for lawyers\, paralegals\, social service providers\, and Muslim women seeking to deepen their understanding of culturally competent legal practice. 
CATEGORIES:Support Programs
END:VEVENT
