BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:the-deadly-weight-of-honour@4dasistas.ca
DTSTAMP:20260918T210051Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260828
SUMMARY:The Deadly Weight of "Honour" 
DESCRIPTION:Time: 14:00\\nDesc: Imagine growing up in a community where the cost of error is your life\, where a single rumour can mark you for death. \nIn some Muslim communities\, distorted ideas of honour have been weaponised into violence\, turning women into the bearers of family reputation and the targets when that reputation is ‘compromised’.\n\nWhy does ‘honour’ weighed more valuable than a women’s life? \nAnd what must we do collectively to dismantle the norms that allow this violence to continue?\n\nJoin us this week for this MWJA Discussion Session. 📢\n🔗 Join Session here: https://t.me/MWJAGLOBAL
CATEGORIES:Support Programs
END:VEVENT
END:VCALENDAR
